"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"18\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong>MÔ TẢ SẢN PHẨM </strong></h3><h4 data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-89\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-405 citation-end-405\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">1. Giới thiệu chung<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"19\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></h4><p data-path-to-node=\"10\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-90\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;\"><span class=\"citation-404\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Rượu Vang Đỏ </span><strong>Viesta Red Wine 750ml</strong><span class=\"citation-404 citation-end-404\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"> là dòng rượu vang nhập khẩu chất lượng đến từ đất nước Chile nổi tiếng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"20\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span> <span class=\"citation-403 citation-end-403\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Được làm từ những trái nho chọn lọc kỹ lưỡng ở vùng thung lũng trù phú kết hợp với công thức lên men chuẩn mực, sản phẩm mang đến hương vị đậm đà, dễ uống, phù hợp cho các bữa tiệc sum họp gia đình, liên hoan hoặc làm quà biếu tặng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"21\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong>2. Đặc điểm và hương vị nổi bật</strong></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-91\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-402 citation-end-402\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Màu sắc quý phái:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"22\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> Rượu sở hữu sắc đỏ ruby đậm đà, sang trọng, tạo điểm nhấn thu hút cho mọi bàn tiệc.<sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-92\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-401 citation-end-401\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Hương vị hài hòa:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"23\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-400 citation-end-400\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Lan tỏa hương thơm phong phú của các loại trái cây chín mọng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"24\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span> <span class=\"citation-399 citation-end-399\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Vị rượu cân bằng với độ chát (tannin) vừa phải, không quá gắt kết hợp cùng vị chua thanh thoát, tạo hậu vị êm mượt và tròn trịa trong khoang miệng.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"25\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-93\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-398 citation-end-398\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Nồng độ lý tưởng (12%):<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"26\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong> <span class=\"citation-397 citation-end-397\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Mức nồng độ nhẹ nhàng, rất dễ thưởng thức, phù hợp cho cả những người mới bắt đầu làm quen với rượu vang.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"27\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node=\"13\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-94\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><strong><span class=\"citation-396 citation-end-396\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">3. Hướng dẫn sử dụng và bảo quản<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"28\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></h4><ul data-path-to-node=\"14\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;font-family:'Google Sans Text', sans-serif !important;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-95\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-395 citation-end-395\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Cách thưởng thức ngon nhất:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"29\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-96\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-394 citation-end-394\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Nhiệt độ thưởng thức lý tưởng nhất từ 16 - 18°C.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"30\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span> <span class=\"citation-393 citation-end-393\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Ngon hơn khi ướp lạnh trước khi uống.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"31\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,0,1,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-97\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-392 citation-end-392\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Tuyệt vời khi dùng kèm các món ăn chế biến từ thịt đỏ (bít tết, thịt bò hầm, sườn nướng), đồ nguội, bánh mỳ hoặc các món BBQ ngoài trời.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"32\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-98\" style=\"\"><strong><span class=\"citation-391 citation-end-391\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Bảo quản:<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"33\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></strong><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng-c1360384063=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\" style=\"padding-inline-start:32px;margin-top:0px !important;\"><li style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1,0,0\" id=\"p-rc_42a2a502581ede24-99\" style=\"\"><span class=\"citation-390 citation-end-390\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\">Để nơi khô ráo, thoáng mát, tránh ánh nắng trực tiếp từ mặt trời.<source-footnote _nghost-ng-c1970046839=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c1970046839=\"\" class=\"superscript\" data-turn-source-index=\"34\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline _nghost-ng-c3257456824=\"\" ng-version=\"0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER\" style=\"margin-top:0px !important;\"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c3257456824=\"\" _nghost-ng